503c7c703e7f0","_from":".","_npmVersion":"2.11.0","_nodeVersion":"0.12.2","_npmUser":{"name":"zemirco","email":"mirco.zeiss@gmail.com"},"dist":{"shasum":"e894ab8ee65c53ede3fcc03a5ef503c7c703e7f0","tarball":"https://registry.npmjs.org/bannerify/-/bannerify-1.0.1.tgz","integrity":"sha512-DCJN8Dcsb7mvySpCwJkbeK5ZABNFJ9eMeuCFCYpUi2Nzg0lGD6Wt22gpLXxWEwFLS3QUED0nCak+5hWQVTVkPw==","signatures":[{"keyid":"SHA256:jl3bwswu80PjjokCgh0o2w5c2U4LhQAE57gj9cz1kzA","sig":"MEUCIDh4yoEqDlgZQE6eIcYgZF6PeAmAm0Er4h2tbD8oUbJCAiEA7exWOAjh+uDpnkrl9zTjylkg1rGS6zGkcpKrkah4WSI="}]},"maintainers":[{"name":"zemirco","email":"mirco.zeiss@gmail.com"}]}},"readme":"\n# bannerify\n\n[![Build Status](https://travis-ci.org/zemirco/bannerify.svg?branch=master)](https://travis-ci.org/zemirco/bannerify)\n\nAdd banner to your browserify bundle.\n\n## Installation\n\n```\n$ npm install bannerify --save-dev\n```\n\n## Usage\n\n`bannerify` uses [lodash templates](https://lodash.com/docs#template).\nInside your template you have access to data from to your `package.json` via `pkg`.\n`moment` is included for human date formatting.\n\nExample `banner.txt` template file.\n\n```\n/**\n * @name    <%= pkg.name %>\n * @version <%= pkg.version %> | <%= moment().format('MMMM Do YYYY') %>\n * @author  <%= pkg.author %>\n * @license <%= pkg.license %>\n */\n```\n\nOutput\n\n```\n/**\n * @name    bannerify\n * @version 1.0.0 | June 11th 2015\n * @author  Mirco Zeiss <mirco.zeiss@gmail.com>\n * @license MIT\n */\n```\n\nWhen using [uglifyjs](https://github.com/mishoo/UglifyJS2) make sure you minify\nwith `--comments` to preserve comments in your minified output.\n\n##### Inline template\n\n```\n$ browserify index.js -p [bannerify --template '/** hello world */'] > bundle.js\n```\n\n##### Template file\n\n```\n$ browserify index.js -p [bannerify --file ./banner.txt ] > bundle.js\n```\n\n## Test\n\n```\n$ npm test\n```\n\n## License\n\nMIT\n","maintainers":[{"name":"zemirco","email":"mirco.zeiss@gmail.com"}],"time":{"modifi